WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.867 --> 00:00:18.778
The dark-haired girl froze in place, her eyes wide with surprise.

2
00:00:18.779 --> 00:00:21.605
Just then Daisy hurried over with a smile.

3
00:00:21.606 --> 00:00:27.162
"That's not my shirt, Henry," she said. "That's Kira's.

4
00:00:27.163 --> 00:00:32.140
We went shopping together last week and bought matching show shirts."

5
00:00:32.141 --> 00:00:35.015
Maggie had followed Henry down the aisle.

6
00:00:35.016 --> 00:00:41.001
"Yeah, Kira's nice," she told Henry. "She and Daisy ride together a lot."

7
00:00:41.002 --> 00:00:46.165
"Oh." Henry felt sheepish. "Sorry," he told Kira.

8
00:00:46.166 --> 00:00:50.094
"I didn't know that you and Daisy had matching shirts."

9
00:00:50.095 --> 00:00:52.835
"It's okay," Kira said softly.

10
00:00:52.836 --> 00:00:58.804
Daisy grinned. "We almost didn't have the same shirts," she told Henry.

11
00:00:58.805 --> 00:01:01.652
"Kira didn't have enough cash with her.

12
00:01:01.653 --> 00:01:05.779
So I lent her a few dollars to pay for her shirt."

13
00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:08.572
Kira nodded and looked down at her shirt.

14
00:01:08.573 --> 00:01:11.833
"My parents were pretty mad about that," she admitted.

15
00:01:11.834 --> 00:01:15.715
"They didn't think I should spend so much without asking them first."

16
00:01:15.716 --> 00:01:19.367
"Sounds like my parents," Maggie said with a snort.

17
00:01:19.368 --> 00:01:24.164
"Except they don't even care if I do ask them. They still say no!"

18
00:01:24.165 --> 00:01:29.888
Henry laughed, but Daisy was starting to look a little upset again as she stared at Kira's shirt.

19
00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:33.941
"Our shirts were expensive," Daisy said.

20
00:01:33.942 --> 00:01:40.257
"I spent three whole weeks' allowance on mine. And now it's gone!"

21
00:01:40.258 --> 00:01:43.409
"Come on, Daisy," Kira said in her soft voice.

22
00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:45.920
"Let's take the ponies for a walk."

23
00:01:45.921 --> 00:01:54.754
"Okay." Daisy led Coco out of her stall again.

24
00:01:54.755 --> 00:02:00.235
After Daisy and Kira left, Henry followed Maggie back toward Big Spot's stall.

25
00:02:00.236 --> 00:02:04.095
He looked around to make sure nobody else was close enough to hear him.

26
00:02:04.096 --> 00:02:07.448
"We have our first suspect," he said.

27
00:02:07.449 --> 00:02:11.384
Then he told Maggie about what Rebecca had said about Coco.

28
00:02:11.385 --> 00:02:17.478
When he finished, Maggie nodded. "Rebecca is pretty spoiled," she said.

29
00:02:17.479 --> 00:02:22.847
"She's always whining about something. She's definitely a good suspect."

30
00:02:22.848 --> 00:02:25.516
"Now we need to look for proof she did it."

31
00:02:25.517 --> 00:02:28.188
Henry glanced around the barn again.

32
00:02:28.189 --> 00:02:33.442
"Are you sure Cole didn't come in here to look for clues by Coco's stall?"

33
00:02:33.443 --> 00:02:38.466
"I'm positive," Maggie said. "I definitely would have seen him."

34
00:02:38.467 --> 00:02:41.569
"So where did he go?" Henry mumbled.

35
00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:47.724
Maggie giggled. "Maybe Cole should be a suspect too," she joked.

36
00:02:47.725 --> 00:02:53.077
"His motive could be that he wants to wear Daisy's show shirt to his next swim meet."

37
00:02:53.078 --> 00:02:55.922
"Very funny." Henry grinned.

38
00:02:55.923 --> 00:03:00.450
"Anyway, I guess the mystery of the missing friend can wait.

39
00:03:00.451 --> 00:03:04.460
If Cole hasn't looked for clues yet, I'd better do it."

40
00:03:04.461 --> 00:03:09.341
"I'll help you," Maggie said. "Big Spot is almost ready for the show.

41
00:03:09.342 --> 00:03:13.345
All I have to do is put his bridle on when it's time for our class."

42
00:03:13.346 --> 00:03:17.072
Henry and Maggie walked over to Coco's empty stall.

43
00:03:17.073 --> 00:03:22.846
"Look." Henry pointed to an empty clothes hanger hanging on the stall door next to a coat.

44
00:03:22.847 --> 00:03:26.285
"This must be where Daisy's shirt was hanging."

45
00:03:26.286 --> 00:03:31.403
"Yeah," Maggie agreed. "It's weird that Daisy's show coat is still here."

46
00:03:31.404 --> 00:03:36.753
She touched the wool coat. "A show coat costs a lot more than a show shirt.

47
00:03:36.754 --> 00:03:39.711
Why wouldn't someone steal that instead?"

48
00:03:39.712 --> 00:03:43.468
"I don't know." Henry saw a boy walking by.

49
00:03:43.469 --> 00:03:50.078
"Excuse me," he said to him. "Did you notice anyone near this stall earlier?"

50
00:03:50.079 --> 00:03:53.878
The boy blinked at him. "No," he said.

51
00:03:53.879 --> 00:03:57.784
"I just got back from giving my horse a bath."

52
00:03:57.785 --> 00:04:02.414
The next rider Henry asked, a teenager named Jill, shook her head.

53
00:04:02.415 --> 00:04:05.326
"I didn't notice anyone," she said.

54
00:04:05.327 --> 00:04:08.979
"Why? Are you guys investigating another mystery?"

55
00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:13.703
"Yes," Henry admitted. "Daisy's show shirt is missing."

56
00:04:13.704 --> 00:04:18.118
"Oh, is that all?" Jill glanced over at Big Spot and grinned.

57
00:04:18.119 --> 00:04:24.391
"Big Spot probably ate it. That pony is always hungry!" She hurried away.

58
00:04:24.392 --> 00:04:28.713
"Do ponies really eat shirts?" Henry asked Maggie.

59
00:04:28.714 --> 00:04:33.098
"Big Spot tries to eat everything, remember?

60
00:04:33.099 --> 00:04:36.195
Or at least he likes to grab things and taste them."

61
00:04:36.196 --> 00:04:41.971
Maggie hurried back to Big Spot's stall. She stepped inside and looked around.

62
00:04:41.972 --> 00:04:44.739
"I don't see the shirt in here, though."

63
00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:49.655
Henry glanced from Big Spot's stall to the spot where Daisy's things were hanging.

64
00:04:49.656 --> 00:04:53.586
"There's no way Big Spot could reach the shirt from here.

65
00:04:53.587 --> 00:04:56.604
I don't think your pony is our culprit."

66
00:04:56.605 --> 00:05:00.201
Henry questioned a few more riders who passed by.

67
00:05:00.202 --> 00:05:03.742
But none of them seemed to know anything about the crime.

68
00:05:03.743 --> 00:05:07.546
Everyone was distracted by the show preparations.

69
00:05:07.547 --> 00:05:10.393
Then Ms. Wood stepped into the barn.

70
00:05:10.394 --> 00:05:16.208
"Riders in the beginners class, please bring your ponies out!" she called in a loud voice.

71
00:05:16.209 --> 00:05:19.358
"It's time to start warming up in the ring."

72
00:05:19.359 --> 00:05:25.509
"Warming up?" Henry said. "I thought everybody would be warm enough already."

73
00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:29.412
"Very funny." Maggie grabbed Big Spot's bridle.

74
00:05:29.413 --> 00:05:31.873
"Hold still, Big Spot," she said.

75
00:05:31.874 --> 00:05:36.099
"I just need to . . . Ugh!" She jumped back quickly.

76
00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:40.712
"What happened?" Henry asked. "Did Big Spot bite you?"

77
00:05:40.713 --> 00:05:43.783
"No! He slimed me!"

78
00:05:43.784 --> 00:05:50.704
Maggie turned around, revealing a huge, bright blue stain on the front of her white shirt.
